    <task id="Id_96c15070-a609-4b52-afb0-b5aff4026371" name="Análise Crítica dos Riscos">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;An&amp;aacute;lise cr&amp;iacute;tica consiste na verifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o se a execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o das medidas de tratamento do risco e dos resultados dessas medidas foram satisfat&amp;oacute;rias para adequar o n&amp;iacute;vel do risco ao limite de exposi&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o definido.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Segoe UI';font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Se for o caso deve-se revisar o limite de exposi&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o ou outros fatores. Por exemplo, um risco pode alterar de limite de exposi&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o para mais ou para menos, ou mesmo ser exclu&amp;iacute;do.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#ECEFFF" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#03689A" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="#FFFFFF" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_2729e1e8-5008-458a-b99e-72b2ef9e06be</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_54edb752-f90d-43cf-baec-6a0ed2d7d836</outgoing>
      <ioSpecification id="Id_8b60884a-b9b2-4ab2-953b-a033ddb17a4a">
